OL,3,GNEWSAHospital porters on five day
OL,4,Astrike
OL,5,
OL,6,FPorters at the Royal Berkshire Hospital
OL,7,Fin Reading who are members of the GMB
OL,8,Funion have started five days of strike
OL,9,Faction.
OL,11,FThe dispute is around changes to
OL,12,Fovertime pay that the Union claims will
OL,13,Fcost porters between six and seven
OL,14,Fpounds every hour of overtime worked.
OL,16,FThe union said during a two-day strike
OL,17,Flast month that 70 porters at the
OL,18,Fhospital are members of the GMB union.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
