OL,3,GNEWSAHospital porters on five day
OL,4,Astrike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Berkshire NHS Foundation
OL,7,FTrust said it is "committed to finding
OL,8,Fa way to resolve the dispute" adding
OL,9,Fthat its "offered a generous package"
OL,10,Fto help reduce the impact on workers.
